# Crumple Zone: extra procnto options (sourced by mkqnximage as bash).
# @CZ_PROC_OPTIONS@ is filled in by image/build-image.sh. Under QEMU TCG we pass
# -h (no CPU halt in the idle thread): a halted emulated CPU has to be woken by
# a host thread signal before it notices an interrupt, which adds 100 us or more
# of emulator latency to every timer wake-up. A spinning idle thread sees it at
# once. On real hardware or KVM leave it empty.
PROC_OPTIONS="@CZ_PROC_OPTIONS@"
